[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	- About last Azure Storage Accounts Outage -
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	 in 
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	context, on the provided text, I found some information about Azure service outages. Here is a summary of the outage:
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	On November 13, 2024, between 00:50 UTC and 12:30 UTC, a subset of Azure Blob Storage and Azure Data Lake Storage accounts experienced connectivity errors. The issue caused loss of access to Blob and Data Lake storage endpoints of the affected storage accounts, leading to unavailability of downstream services that depended on these storage accounts.
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	The incident lasted for approximately 11 hours and 40 minutes, from 00:50 UTC to 12:30 UTC. The impacted services included:
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	• Azure Log Analytics (delays and/or stale data in West Europe, Southeast Asia, and Korea Central regions)
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	• Azure Container Registry (intermittent 5XX errors while trying to pull images from the East US region)
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	Here is a summary of the outages, services impacted, and region/availability zone information:
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	Outages:
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	    Azure Storage: DNS resolution failures in Australia East, Canada Central, Canada East, Central US, East US, East US 2, Japan East, South Central US, UAE North, West US, and/or West US 2.
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	        Affected services: Blob and Data Lake storage API requests
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	        Duration: Not specified
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	    Azure Container Registry: Intermittent 5XX errors in the East US region while trying to pull images from the registry.
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	        Affected services: None specified, but likely related to Azure Storage
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	        Duration: Not specified
